---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Kenzap"
  description="Privacy policy for the Kenzap website and Kenzap Nesting App."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <section class="privacy-shell">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to Kenzap</a>
      <div class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy for the Kenzap website and Kenzap Nesting App</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        This Privacy Policy explains what information may be processed when you use the Kenzap
        website and the Kenzap Nesting App. As of April 18, 2026, Kenzap Nesting App does not
        collect or transmit user data to Kenzap.
      </p>

      <div class="meta">Last updated: April 18, 2026</div>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Scope</h2>
        <p>
          This policy applies to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>the Kenzap marketing website and related localized pages,</li>
          <li>the Kenzap Nesting App desktop application, and</li>
          <li>direct contact with us through the email addresses or external profiles linked on the website.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Website data</h2>
        <p>
          The website is primarily informational. We do not require account registration to browse it.
        </p>
        <p>
          When you visit the website, standard technical information may be processed by the hosting
          infrastructure or your browser, such as IP address, browser type, device information,
          timestamps, requested pages, and basic request logs. This data is typically used for site
          delivery, reliability, and security.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you contact us by email, LinkedIn, GitHub, YouTube, or another linked third-party service,
          we may receive the information you choose to share with us through those services.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you use the support form on this website, the submission is processed through Netlify
          Forms. In that case, the information you enter in the form, along with related technical
          metadata required to deliver and protect the form submission, may be processed by Netlify.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Kenzap Nesting App data</h2>
        <p>
          Kenzap Nesting App is a desktop application intended to process nesting jobs locally on the
          user’s machine.
        </p>
        <p>
          At this time, the app does not intentionally collect analytics, telemetry, personal data,
          uploaded files, DXF content, job history, or cloud account data for transmission to Kenzap.
        </p>
        <p>
          DXF files and other working data are handled locally by the app on your device. If this
          changes in a future release, this Privacy Policy should be updated before or at the time such
          processing is introduced.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          The current website implementation is not intended to provide user accounts or in-app
          behavioral tracking. However, basic browser, hosting, or third-party service behavior may
          still involve technical storage or network logging necessary to load pages and external links.
        </p>
        <p>
          The support form also uses spam-protection measures including Netlify reCAPTCHA. Depending on
          how the service is delivered, Netlify and reCAPTCHA providers may process device, browser,
          network, and interaction data to help distinguish legitimate submissions from automated abuse.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          The website links to or relies on third-party services including Netlify, GitHub, LinkedIn,
          YouTube, and reCAPTCHA-related providers. If you interact with those services, their own
          privacy policies and terms apply.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We only expect to retain information that you voluntarily send to us, or technical records
          reasonably required for security, delivery, and support. Retention periods depend on the
          nature of the communication or operational need.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to request access, correction, deletion,
          or restriction regarding personal data that relates to you. If you want to make such a
          request, contact us using the email below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy-related questions, contact:
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:support@kenzap.com">support@kenzap.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    :global(body) {
      background: #f6f7fc;
      color: #0a0a08;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .privacy-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 48px 24px 96px;
    }

    .privacy-shell {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px;
      background: rgba(246, 247, 252, 0.92);
      border: 1px solid #dde1f0;
    }

    .back-link,
    .eyebrow,
    .meta {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      color: #4a4f5c;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      color: #0a0a08;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #1941df;
    }

    h1,
    h2 {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #0a0a08;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
      line-height: 0.98;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #4a4f5c;
    }

    .meta {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #8a9099;
    }

    section + section {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    p,
    li {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #4a4f5c;
    }

    p + p {
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    ul {
      margin: 12px 0 0 20px;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li + li {
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    a {
      color: #0a0a08;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .privacy-page {
        padding: 24px 16px 72px;
      }

      .privacy-shell {
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
